# 文案体检：常用命令的回显文本。
#
# 真服那边每条命令回一行。这份用例是"逐条对照"的回归基线——
# 2026-10-20 拿它和真服逐条比过，35 条里只有 /seed 的值不同
# （真服每次随机，gomc 固定 0，因为 gomc 是确定性解释器）。
#
# 故意包含几条**没有回显**的命令（give / clear / replaceitem / kill /
# effect）：目标不存在时真服也不说话，gomc 同样不说话。
#
# 故意**不含 /seed**：它的文案对，但值每次都随机（gomc 固定 0，因为它是
# 确定性解释器），录进基线就对不上了。

--- console ---
scoreboard objectives add probe_obj dummy
gamerule doFireTick false
gamerule doFireTick true
time set 18000
time set 1000
difficulty peaceful
difficulty normal
difficulty 1
defaultgamemode creative
defaultgamemode survival
setworldspawn 0 4 0
weather clear
weather rain 60
weather thunder 30
say hello world
me waves
give @a stone 1
clear @a stone
replaceitem entity @a slot.hotbar.0 stone
kill @e[type=armor_stand]
effect @a minecraft:speed 30 1
summon armor_stand 1 4 1
setblock 2 4 2 stone
fill 3 4 3 4 4 4 stone
clone 5 4 5 6 4 6
scoreboard players set Steve probe_obj 5
scoreboard players add Steve probe_obj 3
scoreboard players remove Steve probe_obj 1
scoreboard players test Steve probe_obj 5
scoreboard players list Steve
scoreboard teams add probe_team
scoreboard teams join probe_team Steve
scoreboard teams list
scoreboard objectives list
scoreboard objectives remove probe_obj
